@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title Incident triage
start
:Record symptom, environment and time;
:Assess access, data and service impact;
:Collect bounded logs without private content;
:Distinguish application failure from infrastructure failure;
:Reproduce safely or identify failing boundary;
:Apply scoped repair or recovery procedure;
:Verify behavior and affected data/files;
:Record cause, evidence and follow-up work;
stop
@enduml
